# CL-DFT-002-v1.0 — DRAFT TIER-2 STANDING CLASS AUTHORIZATIONS

**Status: DRAFT — non-activating.** Creating/authorizing a standing class is a §9 strictly-human act; this is prepared for the operator's **one-time** authorization. Nothing runs until (R0.1 passes) + (operator authorizes the class) + (shadow pilot passes).
**Purpose:** once authorized, models auto-terminalize items in these classes **without per-item operator sign-off** — the mechanism for the hands-off autonomy requested. You bless the class once; the cascade runs itself.

## Conditions common to ALL classes (R0.1 §6.4)
Complete numbered package; exact object / evidence / exclusions / dependencies / terminal label / register actions / reopening rule; the class-required independent affirmative reviews; no unresolved material objection; matching source/receipt hashes; a current (unexpired) authorization; a successful dry-run vs the live registers immediately before write. Shadow-pilot ≥3 cases before the first live write (§6.3). Every terminalization / reopening / expiry / revocation / alarm surfaced to Dylan (§6.5). All writes additive, audited, pausable, reversible (§10).

## Class A — Deterministic interval / monotonicity certificates (EC-020 type)
- **Predicate:** closure asserts only that a declared fixed coordinate box satisfies encoded interval + monotonicity inequalities with positive margin on a declared parameter domain. Excludes any probability / mass / exact-field / adjacency / theorem claim.
- **Independence:** ≥2 reviews, **distinct-provider (organizational)** — capsule reconstructed and intervals re-run with outward rounding; planted controls must fail as intended.
- **Register writes:** Closure Log entry + queue removal + dashboard reconcile only.
- **Expiry:** 90 days or 20 successful cycles (whichever first); renew only with re-attestation.
- **Controls:** pause `PAUSE CLASS A`; revoke `REVOKE CLASS A`; reopen `REOPEN <id>`.

## Class B — Fixed-r / small-r qualitative positivity (EC-021, EC-017 type)
- **Predicate:** closure asserts only qualitative existence (∃ r₁,c>0) of positive typed mass on a declared box/law; no numerical constant; no exact-field substitution; no P0.1 / theorem.
- **Independence:** ≥2 reviews, **distinct-provider** (any class touching Palm / mass objects).
- Register writes / expiry / controls as Class A.

*(Same template extends to: exact algebraic / normal-form identities (EC-005..008 type) and negative-result retirements — add on request.)*

## One-time operator authorization (per class), via CL-SPEC-001 format — example
`AUTHORIZE TIER-2 STANDING CLASS A UNDER OP-PROT-008-R0.1 — auto-terminalization permitted on all stated conditions; shadow-pilot 3 cases first; expiry 90d / 20 cycles; excludes everything outside the class predicate. — Dylan M. Roy`
